lines:
你要向深处去吗？{be01}
那么帮我收集一些浅滩海盐
和浅滩贝壳怎么样？{be01}
如果有足够的材料的话，
我可以帮你制作点好东西。

If you bring me four each of the
Shoal Salt and Shoal Shells,{be00}
I can make you a Shell Bell...{be01}
You can get those ingredients
every day.

All righty, then! I’ll make you a
Shell Bell right away.{be01}
... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...
... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...{be01}
There! Done!

Have a Pokémon hold on to that.
It’ll love it, that’s for certain.{be01}
Why, the Shell Bell’s chime...
It’s simply sublime!{be01}
You can get its ingredients every
day, so I can make you more.
